    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Athena Tacha recalls her membership of E.A.T., her 1969 benefit show at Nina Sundell and Marjorie Talalay's New Gallery in Cleveland, and the Cleveland E.A.T. group that put artists in touch with scientists."
      }
    ]
