    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Leo Castelli dismisses Robert Rauschenberg's years in the 'Art and Technology affair', his large metal, sound and electronic pieces, as wasted time, and contrasts Bruce Nauman's offhand use of holograms."
      }
    ]
  },
