      }
    ],
    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Robert Morris denies involvement in E.A.T., prefers the Pulsa group's work, and recalls directing Yvonne Rainer's 9 Evenings piece when she fell ill, judging the event a noble failure with an overcomplex switching system."
      }
    ]
  },
