    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Nancy Burson recalls contacting E.A.T. after she began making art in New York in 1968, being referred to the computer graphics engineer Carl Machover, and his later introducing her to Nicholas Negroponte at MIT."
      }
    ]
