    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: A. Michael Noll gives a hostile verdict on E.A.T., saying Billy Kl\u00fcver's insistence on artist-engineer pairs and the attention paid to Knowlton and Harmon's Computer Nude stalled computer art."
      }
    ]
  },
