    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Oliver Andrews, looking back, sees E.A.T., Rauschenberg and Kl\u00fcver's 9 Evenings and Hult\u00e9n's Machine show at MoMA as a passing faith in technology that artists later left for simpler, outdoor work."
      }
    ]
