    "description": [
      {
        "@value": "About E.A.T.: Morton Subotnick, an outsider who attended its events, sees E.A.T. as born in the gallery world, linking artists like Merce Cunningham to Bell Labs engineers via Billy Kl\u00fcver and Max Mathews, and bypassing technologist artists."
      }
    ]
